<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-12T07:34:09.383Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:34:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis launched a second missile strike on Riyadh airport, killing an airline captain and others and injuring many, prompting the airport's closure and Saudi vows of retaliation. A Pakistani national was also killed in this attack. Simultaneously a migrant boat from Djibouti to Yemen capsized, killing 139 people, including children. Iran’s foreign minister urged diplomacy in a call with his Saudi counterpart, while Iran-backed militants continue to tighten pressure on Saudi Arabia’s Crown Prince. The conflict produced 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261012-houthi-strike-riyadh-airport-yemen&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168559&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/09/houthi-missile-strikes-kill-three-at-riyadh-airport-including-airline-captain&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNc0N1cmRqaFV6M2o1NHlPUWJnbHdlLVcyQUwxeTRXbTB0ejVuRXM2dkVuaTRWeWNEWEp4NDdhT2pvMVBWbENYdnVydXNLdk13Qk5JSC11YS1xOXJwNVNNczlxX0ZqOUhrelNVc21sRzJ1cm1RczhsZm1UcV94c1AtZ3ZBdEIyU0M0YzN0NU1XU3lJeUVpckJYWWNQYjRsRGNhT2NzME5NN2Q0UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPMF95Nm5HV1pQeTVrX1hkaU52bkVfQUNCcjlMMVVUazlFalZpd3dnTVdvOTAxMWdZMk1wU1hfNHkyYXBVY2ZnbnVUa0N2Nm9uOTVTYVQzeGphOExkTWtoRElvUzBqMS1PWkpOQ1VpZy1VN0tUQ2hmYzV5WG1uRVFBb00yb3RjZDZ6andza0lBak9HVXl2QVFZeWk4NXVpc0d4OTVnX2FSY203allXNVlLa1lENGI1bnFLWG1IQVZlS0NyYjZWTUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPX0hNZkk0ZjJsYm5rYklBQmtfeDhWT21nekVtX0ZwNXpNcm